        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-21T03:05:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ketigid\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ketigid:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Awesome!!more of us should do this. And maybe explain strategies and choice of cards played.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Actually, I've been wanting to make a video series for a while with each video being a guide to each hero and villain. Flamethrower has been doing that in text format elsewhere here on the forums, but I like making videos more. And I've actually got great film and audio equipment at my disposal.</p>\n<p>Those videos, however, would certainly be more bite-sized. Maybe two minutes each.</p>",
